[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16500.07, "timestamp": "04:35:00", "text": "嗯，我不想那样，或者像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16501.91, "timestamp": "04:35:01", "text": "你知道，比如上J Show之类的节目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16504.99, "timestamp": "04:35:04", "text": "那。 《Oh my god, my game》也是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16508.949, "timestamp": "04:35:08", "text": "冻住了。好的。咒骂之类的也一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16514.67, "timestamp": "04:35:14", "text": "你知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16517.83, "timestamp": "04:35:17", "text": "什么？呃，我不能撒谎说我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16520.39, "timestamp": "04:35:20", "text": "以前从未有过这种感觉，我不是那种人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16522.75, "timestamp": "04:35:22", "text": "就像纯洁的天使一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16525.869, "timestamp": "04:35:25", "text": "诺伊，我希望，我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16531.709, "timestamp": "04:35:31", "text": "但是，从某种意义上说，我已经做到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16536.23, "timestamp": "04:35:36", "text": "它。呃，我很久以前有个问题，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16540.551, "timestamp": "04:35:40", "text": "我还是不太喜欢它。氢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16543.869, "timestamp": "04:35:43", "text": "它就像一个角色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16547.189, "timestamp": "04:35:47", "text": "您在开发领域有所了解"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16550.31, "timestamp": "04:35:50", "text": "做某件事，但你感觉不想做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16553.109, "timestamp": "04:35:53", "text": "因为有些东西是不能擦掉的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16555.51, "timestamp": "04:35:55", "text": "用或者其他什么东西，然后你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16559.709, "timestamp": "04:35:59", "text": "别再那样做了，想想看"}]